  "No sources yet. Until you add one, the app plays what you already have — anything in Downloads, and any magnet or torrent file you open yourself.": "Vēl nav avotu. Kamēr nepievienosiet kādu, lietotne atskaņo to, kas jums jau ir — visu no Lejupielādēm un jebkuru magnet vai torrent failu, ko atverat pats.",
  "No storage settings on this device. Format the drive as FAT32 on a computer — every Android box accepts it.": "Šajā ierīcē nav krātuves iestatījumu. Formatējiet disku kā FAT32 datorā — to pieņem katra Android pierīce.",
