  "That's everything.": "Tas arī viss.",
  "The connection to the torrent engine dropped mid-stream.": "Savienojums ar torrentu dzinēju pārtrūka straumes vidū.",
  "The download couldn't be started.": "Neizdevās sākt lejupielādi.",
  "The download didn't finish.": "Lejupielāde netika pabeigta.",
  "The exception is Dolby or DTS handed straight to a receiver over HDMI, which Android does where it can — nothing in the app touches that sound, so neither setting has any effect on it. An amplifier doing that has a night mode of its own.": "Izņēmums ir Dolby vai DTS, kas pa HDMI tiek padots tieši uztvērējam, kā Android dara tur, kur var — lietotnē šai skaņai neviens nepieskaras, tāpēc neviens no iestatījumiem to neietekmē. Pastiprinātājam, kas tā dara, ir paša nakts režīms.",
  "The film is played as it was mixed.": "Filma tiek atskaņota tā, kā tā tika samiksēta.",
  "The link this source gave answered HTTP {status}. It may have expired — search the sources again for a fresh one.": "Šī avota sniegtā saite atbildēja ar HTTP {status}. Iespējams, tā ir beigusies — meklējiet avotos vēlreiz, lai iegūtu jaunu.",
  "The link this source gave could not be reached.": "Saiti, ko deva šis avots, neizdevās sasniegt.",
  "The other device refused the film.": "TODO_TRANSLATION: The other device refused the film.",
  "The other device streams this film from here, so nothing is downloaded twice. Both have to be on the same network, and it has to be switched on for casting under Settings → Network.": "TODO_TRANSLATION: The other device streams this film from here, so nothing is downloaded twice. Both have to be on the same network, and it has to be switched on for casting under Settings → Network.",
  "The picture currently behind the app": "Attēls, kas pašlaik ir aiz lietotnes",
  "The player area never got a size, so playback was not started.": "Atskaņotāja apgabals nekad nesaņēma izmēru, tāpēc atskaņošana netika sākta.",
  "The player itself — decoding, subtitles and audio. GPLv2 or later.": "Pats atskaņotājs — dekodēšana, subtitri un audio. GPLv2 vai jaunāka.",
  "The project does not host, run, endorse or recommend any source, and does not distribute a list of them.": "Projekts nemitina, neuztur, neatbalsta un neiesaka nevienu avotu, kā arī neizplata to sarakstu.",
  "The project on GitHub": "Projekts GitHub",
  "The release carries no update for this platform.": "Izdevumā nav atjauninājuma šai platformai.",
  "The source fetched this already — it plays at once and keeps nothing on this device": "Avots to jau ir ieguvis — atskaņojas uzreiz un neko neatstāj šajā ierīcē",
  "The supporter list couldn't be loaded — the Ko-fi page above has the current one.": "Neizdevās ielādēt atbalstītāju sarakstu — aktuālais ir iepriekš redzamajā Ko-fi lapā.",
  "The torrent engine accepted the magnet but gave it no id.": "Torrentu dzinējs pieņēma magnet, bet nepiešķīra tam ID.",
  "The torrent engine, embedded in the app. MIT licensed.": "Torrentu dzinējs, iebūvēts lietotnē. MIT licence.",
  "The torrent stream isn't ready yet (engine replied HTTP {status}). It may still be fetching metadata from peers.": "Torrenta straume vēl nav gatava (dzinējs atbildēja ar HTTP {status}). Iespējams, tas joprojām saņem metadatus no vienaudžiem.",
  "The update couldn't be installed: {error}": "Neizdevās instalēt atjauninājumu: {error}",
  "Theme": "Motīvs",
  "There is barely room for one film here. Plug a USB drive into the box — formatted FAT32, which every Android box accepts — and it appears above to download onto instead.": "Šeit tik tikko pietiek vietas vienai filmai. Pievienojiet pierīcei USB disku — formatētu kā FAT32, ko pieņem katra Android pierīce — un tas parādīsies augšpusē, lai lejupielādētu uz tā.",
  "There is no account to sign in to and nothing syncs to a server. What you watch, how far you got, your favourites and your watchlist are all stored on this device and never leave it. Syncing between screens is planned; until then, the backup below is how a library moves.": "Nav konta, kurā pieteikties, un nekas netiek sinhronizēts uz serveri. Ko skatāties, cik tālu esat ticis, jūsu izlase un skatīšanās saraksts — viss glabājas šajā ierīcē un nekad to nepamet. Sinhronizācija starp ekrāniem ir plānota; līdz tam dublējums zemāk ir veids, kā pārvietot bibliotēku.",
  "There's no {file} in your documents folder. Copy one there and try again.": "Jūsu dokumentu mapē nav neviena {file}. Nokopējiet vienu tur un mēģiniet vēlreiz.",
  "This connection is metered right now.": "Šis savienojums pašlaik ir mērīts.",
  "This connection is not metered right now.": "Šis savienojums pašlaik nav mērīts.",
  "This copy wasn't installed by Ventic's own installer — a package manager, or a build from source — so whatever put it there is what updates it. Replacing the files from in here would only confuse it.": "Šo kopiju neinstalēja paša Ventic instalētājs — bet pakotņu pārvaldnieks vai būvējums no pirmkoda — tāpēc to atjaunina tas, kas to tur ielika. Failu aizstāšana no šejienes to tikai samulsinātu.",
  "This device couldn't start serving the film to the network.": "TODO_TRANSLATION: This device couldn't start serving the film to the network.",
  "This device is called": "TODO_TRANSLATION: This device is called",
  "This device is streaming a film to another one right now.": "TODO_TRANSLATION: This device is streaming a film to another one right now.",
  "This device is streaming the film to it. Leave Ventic running until you're done — closing it stops the stream.": "TODO_TRANSLATION: This device is streaming the film to it. Leave Ventic running until you're done — closing it stops the stream.",
  "This device isn't on a network Ventic can see. Type the other device's address instead.": "TODO_TRANSLATION: This device isn't on a network Ventic can see. Type the other device's address instead.",
  "This device's decoder gave up on the file. That is usually the audio: Dolby (AC-3, E-AC-3, TrueHD) and DTS are not licensed into the system webview, so a release carrying one plays as a picture with no sound, or not at all. An x264 release with AAC audio will play.": "Šīs ierīces dekoders padevās šim failam. Parasti vainojams audio: Dolby (AC-3, E-AC-3, TrueHD) un DTS nav licencēti sistēmas tīmekļa skatā, tāpēc izdevums ar tādu skaņu atskaņojas kā attēls bez skaņas vai nemaz. x264 izdevums ar AAC audio atskaņosies.",
  "This file has one audio track.": "Šim failam ir viens audio celiņš.",
